---
import PageHero from './PageHero.astro';
import FAQ from './FAQ.astro';
import Button from './Button.astro';
---
<PageHero label="Pricing" title="Start free. Pay for what you build." description="Get a roadmap first. For hands-on work, review the scope and price before you approve anything."/>
<section class="section wrap">
  <div class="section-head"><h2>Choose what you need.</h2></div>
  <div class="grid3">
    <article class="card"><h3>Free roadmap</h3><p>Tell Auri your goals, see your recommended steps and choose where to start.</p></article>
    <article class="card"><h3>One-time projects</h3><p>Get an agreed price for work such as a website build, QR menu setup or a brand project.</p><p class="mt-3" data-price-id="launch">Request a quote for a website</p></article>
    <article class="card"><h3>Ongoing care</h3><p>Compare recurring options for keeping your site updated or online.</p><p class="mt-3" data-care-price data-price-id="essential-care">Request a quote for ongoing care</p></article>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="section wrap" data-reveal>
  <div class="section-head"><h2>Compare costs and coverage.</h2><p>Monthly website care and annual hosting cover different work. Choose a billing period to see what applies.</p></div>
  <div class="filters" aria-label="Recurring billing period"><button type="button" data-period="month" aria-pressed="true">Monthly</button><button type="button" data-period="year" aria-pressed="false">Annual</button></div>
  <div class="table-wrap" role="region" aria-label="Pricing comparison" tabindex="0">
    <table><thead><tr><th scope="col">What’s included</th><th scope="col">Free roadmap</th><th scope="col">Project</th><th scope="col">Ongoing</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><th scope="row">Suggested plan</th><td>Included</td><td>Included</td><td>Included</td></tr>
        <tr><th scope="row">Hands-on work</th><td>Available by request</td><td>Agreed deliverables</td><td data-care-description>Website updates and upkeep</td></tr>
        <tr><th scope="row">Payment</th><td>Free</td><td>One-time scope</td><td data-care-price data-price-id="essential-care">Request a quote</td></tr>
        <tr><th scope="row">Tracking</th><td>Growth roadmap</td><td>Requests and drafts</td><td>Service and renewal details</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="section wrap grid2"><div class="section-head"><h2>You approve the scope first.</h2><p>Before committing, see what the team will deliver, when it’s expected and how much it will cost.</p><div><Button href="/contact" variant="outline">Talk to our team</Button></div></div><article class="card"><h3>Optional add-ons</h3><p>Extra pages, business email, managed hosting or ongoing updates can be added to a quote when needed.</p><Button href="/packages" variant="ghost">See website care plans</Button></article></section>
<FAQ items={[
 ['Do I pay to get a roadmap?','You can start with a free roadmap. You decide whether to request a paid service.'],
 ['Are monthly and annual options the same service?','The published catalogue offers monthly website care and annual infrastructure. The work covered depends on the option.'],
 ['What if my needs change?','Contact the team for a revised scope before approving extra work.'],
]}/>
